# DWES Project Profile

Maintained working model of the Digital Wiring Execution System. Update when stack,
ports, or major structure changes.

## CURSOR PROJECT CONFIG (official layout)

Per [Cursor Rules](https://cursor.com/docs/rules), [Skills](https://cursor.com/docs/skills), and [MCP](https://cursor.com/docs/mcp):

```
.cursor/
├── rules/*.mdc          # Project rules (frontmatter: description, alwaysApply, globs)
├── skills/*/SKILL.md    # Project skills (frontmatter: name, description, paths)
└── mcp.json             # MCP servers (mcpServers, type: stdio)
```

| Component | DWES status | Notes |
|-----------|-------------|-------|
| Rules | 6 `.mdc` files | Always-apply + glob-scoped |
| Skills | 3 project skills | `dwes-project` index + 2 specialists |
| MCP | `mcp.json` | `${workspaceFolder}` / `${env:DATABASE_URL}` |
| Subagents | — | Not configured (built-in subagents sufficient) |
| Hooks | — | Not configured (no automation requirement) |
| Plugins | — | Not applicable (single-app repo, not a distributable plugin) |
| Commands | — | Not configured (use skills + rules per Cursor 2.4+ guidance) |

